  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "系統工程與管理",
    "sub_ename": "SYSTEMS ENGINEERING AND MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "面對全球化，無論是製造業或服務業要想提高競爭力、創造力、與國際企業接軌，甚或同步發展，因而亟需運用「系統工程技術」，開創整體系統化的解決方案，以減少決策錯誤、降低風險、節省成本、確保品質、發揮綜效。本課程將從需求分析、規格訂定、概念開發、設計、生產製造、組裝、測試、以及到維修服務等產品全壽期發展之系統工程技術的角度，培養學生具有系統整合與創造產品附加價值的知識與應用能力。同時教育學生工程倫理的觀念。",
    "describe_eh": "Facing globalization, either manufacturing or service industries all eager to improve their competence and creativity.  They even also collaborate with other industry to speed up the development of new products.  By applying systems engineering technology, industry can evolve a total solution for the customers, avoiding decision mistake, mitigating risk, reducing cost and time to market, conforming quality and reaching total effectiveness for themselves.  This course intends to provide students with the systems integration and innovation knowledge and application capability from the product lifecycle development aspects of systems engineering with the requirements analysis, specification arrangement, concept development, design, manufacturing, assembly, test, verification & validation, maintenance service in mind.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "建立對系統工程與管理的整體認知。",
      "describe_en": "Based on the overall industrial system and development trend, students are able to know the importance of systems engineering and management."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "從產品全壽期管理角度認識學習系統與整合技術，建立系統化解決問題能力。",
      "describe_en": "Students can build up providing systematic solutions capability from the product lifecycle management point of view through learning system integration methodology and technique."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "培養團隊合作",
      "describe_en": "Team work"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解現在環境的變化與挑戰",
      "describe_en": "Students are able to understand the change and challenge of current environment"
    }
  ],
